[{"form_id":"0x00084A|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああっ！ カイネにかけて、驚いたじゃないか！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000807|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んん…な、何だ？ お前か！ そりゃそうだ！ 最高だよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000802|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"えーと…おい、あんた。やっと目が覚めたようだな！ 待て、違う！ うーん…ちょっと考えさせてくれ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000804|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んん…な、何だ？ どうして。やっと静かな一日になると思ったのに。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000806|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"真夜中に人を叩き起こすとはな。世も末だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000803|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、真夜中に人を起こすほどの、よほど重要な話があるんだろうね？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000805|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んん…な、何だ？ やっと夜にゆっくり眠れると思ったのに。そうでもないか。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000844|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まったく、失礼な奴だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000826|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うわっ！ 年寄りをいじめるとは！ わしが何をしたというんだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000845|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いやはや、こんな風に邪魔をされたのは初めてだ…何と厚かましい！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000843|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なぜだ！？ なぜだ？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082C|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、だめ、だめ！ 起きろ、起きろ！ な、何だ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080D|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"カジートはもう疲れた。他の奴を煩わせろ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083E|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、昼寝から起きたような気分だ！ 頼んでもいないのに！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083F|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何か用か？ ない？！ なら放っておいてくれ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000840|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だっ…？ シャーーーッ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000841|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"だから人付き合いは避けてるんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000846|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、驚いた。何の用だ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00084B|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もうくたくただ…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000827|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"敬意に欠ける振る舞いだな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00084C|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ？ 失礼なことは言いたくないが、今は都合が悪いんだ。横にならないと。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000842|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ？！ 今はおしゃべりの時間じゃない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000839|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ん？ まったく情けない。年長者は敬うものだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000825|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ？ まったく、失礼な奴だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082A|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ありがとうよ。眠りなんて弱者のものだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000828|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ん？ 何だ？ 何と厚かましい！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000824|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"眠らないと…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000834|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"大事な用だといいんだが。ただでさえろくに眠れてないんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082E|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"完璧だ、ちょうどこういうのが欲しかったんだよ。何の用だ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000820|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うわっ！ 何をした？ やめろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083A|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"本当にそんな気分じゃないんだ。用件を言うか、さっさと帰るかしてくれ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000822|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ここで何をしている？ もう寝ている時間だろう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000830|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"本気か？ 言え！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081E|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、お前か。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000829|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"忙しいんだ、邪魔をするな。あっちへ行け。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000821|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ？ こんなことに付き合ってる暇はない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000832|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んん、何だ？ 何てことだ！ こんなことに付き合ってる暇はない！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000831|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"素晴らしい。今度は何が必要なんだ…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000836|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、そりゃそうだ、完璧だよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000835|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"冗談だろ？ んん、何の用だ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081F|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"な、何だ？ うーん…今は話をしている時じゃない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083C|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ぐっすり眠れるって素晴らしいことだよな、そう思わないか、ん？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083B|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ？ 今はおしゃべりの時間じゃない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083D|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああっ！ 汚らわしいヌワーめ！ アーケイに免じて放っておいてくれ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081C|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何てことだ、何をぐずぐずしてる？ 放っておいてくれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081D|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ？！ さっさと言え。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081B|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"忙しいんだ。何かやることはないのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000849|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んん…何だ？ 放っておいてくれ、何の用だ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000833|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ん？ 今は話をしている時じゃない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000815|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"話せ。お前が早く出ていけば、それだけ早く眠れる。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000847|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何てことだ、何の用だ？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000837|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ、バカなのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000818|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んん？ 何だって？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000848|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"結構、素晴らしい。おかげで一日が台無しだ。何の用だ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080B|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"九大神よ、疲れた…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000819|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前…！ どうして？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000817|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よくもそんな真似を！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000812|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"冗談だろ？ 話がしたい。今。それで起こしたのか？ ん？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082B|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"今はその時じゃない、眠らせてくれ。体力も我慢も限界なんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080C|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ？ ろくに寝てないんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000813|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"今どうしても邪魔しなきゃならないのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000811|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ん？ 何の用だ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000809|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なんてこと。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080E|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"大事な用でもない限り、二度と邪魔するな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000808|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"疲れてるんだ。放っておいてくれ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080A|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、もうくたくただ…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000801|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"大事な用だといいんだが。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080F|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"大事な用なんだろうな？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000810|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んん…眠い…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D6A|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何を…え？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D6C|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よほどの用なんだろうな…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000800|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"大事な用なんだろうな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000823|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ぶらぶらするな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082F|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ、ドラゴンか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D69|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"女が一人でゆっくりすることもできないの？ 出ていって！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082D|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何事だ？ ここにいるまっとうな理由があるんだろうな。でなきゃ衛兵を呼ぶぞ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D6B|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"本当にそこまでする必要があったのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D6D|sleeping expanded.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この野郎…","index":1}]